{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29976","headline":"夏日因怀阳羡旧游寄裴书记 · 喻凫","name":"夏日因怀阳羡旧游寄裴书记","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落日太湖西，波涵万象低。\n藕花熏浦溆，菱蔓匿凫鷖。\n树及长桥尽，滩回七里迷。\n还应坐筹暇，时一梦荆溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"喻凫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29976.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29976","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}